Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have just returned\Nfrom the Eastern Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is not much time\Nbefore it crumbles away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Army of the Dark marches through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have 50,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have but 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as training them,\Nwe are doing all we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where are the other Integrity Knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they all out on patrol?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I made my approach,\NI could only see seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are all we have here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:03:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Counting the two of us, there\Nshould be 31 Knights in the Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technically, there are, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know as well as I,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when a knight showed signs of distress,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chudelkin would use the\Narts to recalibrate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the last count, ten knights\Nhave yet to be awakened from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Currently, twenty-one knights are active.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are four stationed at the\Ncathedral to guard the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and four are on patrol\Nover the End Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That only leaves thirteen, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, we are\Nstretched far too thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with all that we face,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brought him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you intend to protect\Nhim while you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've sworn to protect him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is nothing but dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you burden yourself with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only will it affect\Nyour ability to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll place you in certain danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Eldrie. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you've been\Ntaking care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even your cheeks filled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he going to kill Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need for that, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle, all right. Tell me what you saw, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think i saw the flash of swords just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tossed an incarnate\Nsword at him well actually
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was more like a dagger it\Nonly would have scratched
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his cheek a bit if it hit\Nhim, that is, if it hit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:05:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that means he that's\Nright he stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it with his willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might not look like\Nhis mind's all there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the kid ain't dead\Nno way and he wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protecting himself when\Nhe blocked my strike he
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.66,0:05:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was protecting you he'll\Nsnap out of it one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you when, but I bet\Nit'll be when you need him the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get hung up on\Nthe small stuff, Eldrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can look after this kid easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though the battle with\NAdministrator cost you your heart, still,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you had the will to protect me\Nfrom Uncle's sword technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to that end, what do I think of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A puppet created to fight using\NAlice Suberg's body as a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not allowed the luxury of emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the will to do battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, what if that is why\NI cannot break through to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I hold myself back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you respond if I\Nunleashed all of my will?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We’ve brought some supper for you, m’lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is your bread and drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see by your uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are from the Swordcraft Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lady, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Primary Trainee Tiese Streenan,\NArmy Supply Corps, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm Primary Trainee\NRonie Arabelle, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do not have to be so formal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a warrior, here to\Nprotect the land, same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, call me Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is wrong? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that when we first\Nmet you at the academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you seemed different than you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:08:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, is there something\NI can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, sorry to primarily,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Alice,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the word around the camp is that\Nyou came here with a black-haired boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew someone at the academy like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we thought we'd come see if\Nit was him, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course I do not mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I recall, you were friends\Nof Kirito's at the academy. I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Yujiro must be here too! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no easy way to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not wish to upset you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, since Yujiro and Kirito were\Nyour mentors, you have the right to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just now, I heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said not to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he'll be here, always.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must love them dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could never...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Alice, when you arrested Kirito\Nand Yuji-Oh, did you know what they did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, they violated one of the taboos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were involved in\Nthe death of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you know what led up to\Nthem breaking that taboo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They raised their swords to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we weren't strong\Nenough to save ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only we'd handled\Nour troubles ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't have rebelled\Nagainst the laws of the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no one would have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.92,0:10:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, we are the ones\Nto blame for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, no matter how\Nwe truly feel about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't say we love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a noble Integrity\NKnight, so you can't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sinners!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cause bloodshed by\Nletting ourselves be defiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.08,0:11:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The body is nothing more than a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your soul, your heart, your\Nsoul, is who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you determine the nature of your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.84,0:11:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like Kirito showed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see? The person you\Nreally are is but the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reflection of your heart\Nand that cannot be defiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born in a tiny\Nvillage I should have grown
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:11:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up to become who you see\Nnow but when I was just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a child I was arrested for\Na crime my memories were
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,erased and I was turned\Ninto an integrity knight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were times I cursed\Nmy fate. However, Kirito
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taught me to overcome\Nit that I had the power
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to I just had to will it\Nand I won't doubt myself
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, I've chosen to\Naccept who I am and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sure given time the two of you\Nwill also find your way and find peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about your friend just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and what to do with him\Nwhen the fighting starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have already made arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:13:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, I was paid a visit by\Nhis former pages from the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust them, so I asked them\Nto look after Kirito. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad that's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, how'd the kid take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did seeing these folks from\Nhis past snap Malvis Fog any?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chin up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me he'll come\Naround, and when he does,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll be the one who sets\Nthe course of this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he got help from\Nyou and his partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing the Prime Senator and the\NPontifex was anything but easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I took him on, I doubt I'd last\Nagainst his incarnate ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, when our wills\Nclashed, I definitely felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's got equal, or hell, even\Nmore experience in real combat than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are much older.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not an experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got way more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Taboo Index forbids\Nbattles to the death,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's got tons of experience with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Question is, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle, he is not from -
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.81,0:14:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is time for the Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Fanatio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's wearing... makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been ages, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been well, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So feminine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.87,0:14:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As well as can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, is it true you brought\Nthat black-haired boy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After our meeting, I would\Nlike to see him for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish to thank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't take long. Thank him? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he defeated\Nme, he fought honorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, that boy is the only\Nmale who fought me with all he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It did not matter to him in the\Nslightest that I happened to be a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:15:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first became a knight and fought\Nwith men, I could tell they held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I donned this helmet and\Nmastered the art of continuous
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attacks to prevent my opponents\Nfrom getting too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, the real issue was that\NI was self-conscious about my gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saw right through me, though, and\Nfought with all his might regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I unleashed all of my sword techniques\Nand arts, and he still bested me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.64,0:15:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, after I healed, my petty\Nobsession had disappeared entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, now do you understand\Nwhy I am so eager to thank him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am also a tad vexed, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My femininity did not register with\Nhim at all once he saw my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought if I saw him I could try a few\Nthings that might stimulate his recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am grateful for your concern,\Nbut he is resting at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make sure to give him your\Nregards when I check on him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it seems you've installed\Nyourself as his guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:16:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whenever the commander was on\Nduty and you wished to speak with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never refused you, not even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not need your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see him anytime I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And another thing, if you\Ntruly wish to be beaten
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,senseless by a male surely\Nuncle here could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,obliged you i would not\Nexpect him to he is the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strongest swordsman in the\Nland he would not spar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with his knights full\Nbore oh you don't say well
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.30,0:16:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whenever i trained with\Nhim he was always drenched.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in sweat from the exertion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's time we\Ngot this meeting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have considered many\Ndifferent strategies
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over the past four months\Nand have concluded that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at our current strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be difficult to\Nrepel an all-out attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On our side of the End Mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is nothing but grassland and rocks\Nfor ten key lords in all directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the enemy advances this far, we\Nwill be surrounded and slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only option is to engage\Nthem in this narrow ravine,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is 100 miles wide\Nand 1,000 miles long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will set up a defensive position here,\Nabsorb their charge, and grind them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be the basic\Nthrust of our strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have any thoughts so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy has ogres and longbows,\Nand even more dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dark mages of untold numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we counteract\Ntheir long-range attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no sunlight in that\Nravine, even during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even the grass grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sacred power is sparse there at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in theory, if we absorb the\Npower from the battlefield first,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their mages won't be able\Nto use it to attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same is true for our side as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the present, we only have\N100 who can wield the arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we allow the battle to come\Ndown to our wielders and theirs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,theirs will use far more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arts are not just\Nused for combat, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all the sacred power is exhausted,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,healing the lives of our critically\Nwounded will be next to impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit, it is a risky gamble,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is why we brought all the reagents\Nand healing potions from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we use our sacred arts only for\Nhealing and the potions for support,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the reagents should last\Nfor at least three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is one more issue, if I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Solus and Terraria's\Nblessings are sparse there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,during the battle, with\Neach warrior who falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more sacred power will be\Nreleased and accumulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not see how we can\Nabsorb all those extra
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resources if there are\Nnot enough of us to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, one of us can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you, Alice Synthesis 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you haven't realized it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your power has surpassed that of\Nall the Integrity Knights in the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you are ready to use it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A godlike power that can\Nsplit heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please look after\NKirito and keep him safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can count on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Alice, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We promise we will protect\Nhim with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, I must leave, and I\Ndo not know if I shall return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life, and I will use all of\Nit, to the last drop if I have to. And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should I fall in battle and call\Nyou with the last of my breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you stand and\Ndraw your sword for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With you awake, it would not matter\Nhow many thousands the enemy has.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will perform another miracle\Nand protect everyone, as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.04,0:20:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you were the one\Nwho defeated the Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the greatest swordsman ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eldrie? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Milady?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have served me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was blessed to have you by my side,\Neven though it was not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You chose an amateur like\Nme to be your mentor,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.26,0:20:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instead of a male veteran\Nlike Serdeo Selbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that out of sympathy for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never be so disrespectful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chose you because I was so in awe of your\Nsword technique and skills as a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it is due to your unwavering support\Nthat I was able to survive to see this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Alice, you speak with such finality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is as if you think your journey,\Ninstead of going on, is about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It cannot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have not learned\Nall I can from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My technique, my arts,\NI am nowhere near ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still need you to continue my training\Nand guide me to be a better knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Integrity Knight, Eldrie Synthesis 31.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As your mentor, here are my final orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.30,0:21:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Survive to witness peace in the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after, you will seek out your true life\Nand take it back, and the one you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
